*symlink* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''symlink(target, linkpath)''

Creates a symbolic link pointing to the target path.

*Parameters:*
- ''target'': String path that the symbolic link will point to
- ''linkpath'': String path where the symbolic link will be created

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if target is not a string
- Runtime error if linkpath is not a string
